Hello <%= @user.email_address %>!

Someone requested a link to change your Beach Volleyball Project password. You can do this through the link below.

<%= "#{ENV.fetch("FRONTEND_URL", "http://localhost:5174")}/reset-password?token=#{@user.password_reset_token}" %>

This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.

If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.